    "Condition : 5 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (as amended) (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) the property shall not be used as anything other than:\r\ni.\tthe specific use described in the submitted planning statement as a Parent and Child Assessment Centre or, \r\nii.\tuses falling under Use Class C3 and C4 of the said Order \r\nIt shall not be used as any other use falling under Use Class C2 of the said Order. \r\n"
